sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as FireFly Analytics
    participant Databricks
    participant Postgres as Database

    Note over User,Postgres: Authentication Flow

    User->>App: Login Request
    App->>Databricks: OAuth Redirect
    Databricks->>User: Login Page
    User->>Databricks: Credentials
    Databricks->>App: Auth Code
    App->>Databricks: Exchange Code for Tokens
    Databricks->>App: Access & Refresh Tokens
    App->>Postgres: Store Encrypted Tokens
    App->>Postgres: Create Session
    App->>User: Set Session Cookie

    Note over User,Postgres: API Request Flow

    User->>App: Request Data
    App->>Postgres: Validate Session
    App->>Postgres: Retrieve OAuth Token
    App->>Databricks: API Call with Token
    Databricks->>App: Data Response
    App->>User: Display Data

    Note over User,Postgres: Token Refresh (if expired)

    App->>Postgres: Get Refresh Token
    App->>Databricks: Refresh Request
    Databricks->>App: New Access Token
    App->>Postgres: Update Token
